<title>SPAIN: Spain approves Enagas sale to Gas Natural.</title>
<headline>Spain approves Enagas sale to Gas Natural.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish holding company SEPI said on Friday it has agreed the sale of its nine percent stake in Enagas to Gas Natural for 14 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Gas Natural now owns 100 percent of the gas distribution company.  </p>
<p>The deal includes Gas Natural taking on the take-or-pay gas supply commitment with Enagas, the statement said.</p>
<p>The operation is pending approval by the cabinet, SEPI said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
